{"2100280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "World of Tanks: HEAT", "steam_appid": 2100280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4873690, 4873680], "detailed_description": "<h1>World of Tanks: HEAT | Season 1: Lost Eden</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/7cc7f69701557abb4079f9b1a9801d38.avif?t=1788084979\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras_big/7cc7f69701557abb4079f9b1a9801d38.webp?t=1788084979 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Agent: Flair (Marksman).</strong> Signature Masking (Trait) hides her from ability lock-ons, and Echo Proxy (Ultimate) deploys a fully functional duplicate of her vehicle for misdirection and ambushes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two New Tanks.</strong> Unlock the LEO 2FK (anti-tank guided missiles, disguises itself as battlefield wreckage) and LEO 2KST (autoloader magazine, Active Camo, EMP Trap for area denial).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Map: Eden.</strong> A deep-desert battlefield built around the remnants of massive biodomes rising above the sands, with abandoned research facilities providing scattered cover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Pass Season 1.</strong> Fifty stages of rewards including both new tanks, all unlockable for free. The rest of the Pass includes a variety of cosmetics, currency, and progression rewards.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/0638fe90275b435d746bea442f531dbc.poster.avif?t=1788084979\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/0638fe90275b435d746bea442f531dbc.webm?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/0638fe90275b435d746bea442f531dbc.mp4?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>World of Tanks: HEAT is a free-to-play vehicle combat game built for dynamic tactical team play. A unique roster of Agents with diverse skillsets and a variety of highly advanced tanks are yours to control. Find your perfect Agent-tank combo, build your ride with hi-tech weaponry, and fight it out in a world where technology and innovation have reinvented tank combat. [/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/ef107e806e5d944fbe14b9e5ee51003a.poster.avif?t=1788084979\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/ef107e806e5d944fbe14b9e5ee51003a.webm?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/ef107e806e5d944fbe14b9e5ee51003a.mp4?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEAT drops you into intense 5v5 skirmishes and larger 10v10 clashes where there’s room for both personal skill and team coordination. There are no &quot;win buttons”; the battlefield is equal for everyone, and victory goes to those who communicate, adapt, and outthink the enemy. Fight, win, lose, master new tricks, and come back stronger every new battle.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/4bb746e7cbd5aff1244605c44a1f2499.poster.avif?t=1788084979\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/4bb746e7cbd5aff1244605c44a1f2499.webm?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/4bb746e7cbd5aff1244605c44a1f2499.mp4?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Agent, each with unique abilities that define how you fight, hold ground, and time your strikes to maintain momentum. Every tank in HEAT is upgradable. Tune your tank and mix experimental modules to match your playstyle. Every combination feels different on the battlefield, so experiment until you find what clicks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/a53a10298013110d85ce72a28454f664.poster.avif?t=1788084979\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/a53a10298013110d85ce72a28454f664.webm?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/a53a10298013110d85ce72a28454f664.mp4?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEAT is powered by a completely new engine built from the ground up, with full support for the most advanced lighting systems, particle effects, and VFX available. This makes every explosion, impact, and ability feel like you’re witnessing it live. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/5415d332244fa1a896d5f01c982e634e.poster.avif?t=1788084979\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/5415d332244fa1a896d5f01c982e634e.webm?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/5415d332244fa1a896d5f01c982e634e.mp4?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEAT runs seamlessly on PC (Wargaming Game Center and Steam), Steam Deck, PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, and GeForce NOW. All your Agents and tanks are ready for action, no matter what gear you play on. Log in with a single Wargaming account to sync your progression instantly across all your devices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/fcc5fea6e2905d4934678470b22184f8.poster.avif?t=1788084979\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/fcc5fea6e2905d4934678470b22184f8.webm?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/fcc5fea6e2905d4934678470b22184f8.mp4?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEAT is set in an alternate post-WWII timeline, where science has triumphed and the world blooms with technical marvels. But peace is fragile, and behind the facade of harmony lurks an intensifying arms race. Your arsenal will be packed with cutting-edge technologies, all based on real-life scientific and design concepts. This &quot;what if&quot; machinery is heavy, brutal, and built to shred armor. It is a world where engineering beauty is forged for the frontlines. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/e18320287f0ea5061225efc433882fdb.avif?t=1788084979\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras_big/e18320287f0ea5061225efc433882fdb.webp?t=1788084979 width=1560 height=596 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/0638fe90275b435d746bea442f531dbc.poster.avif?t=1788084979\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/0638fe90275b435d746bea442f531dbc.webm?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/0638fe90275b435d746bea442f531dbc.mp4?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>World of Tanks: HEAT is a free-to-play vehicle combat game built for dynamic tactical team play. A unique roster of Agents with diverse skillsets and a variety of highly advanced tanks are yours to control. Find your perfect Agent-tank combo, build your ride with hi-tech weaponry, and fight it out in a world where technology and innovation have reinvented tank combat. [/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/ef107e806e5d944fbe14b9e5ee51003a.poster.avif?t=1788084979\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/ef107e806e5d944fbe14b9e5ee51003a.webm?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/ef107e806e5d944fbe14b9e5ee51003a.mp4?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEAT drops you into intense 5v5 skirmishes and larger 10v10 clashes where there’s room for both personal skill and team coordination. There are no &quot;win buttons”; the battlefield is equal for everyone, and victory goes to those who communicate, adapt, and outthink the enemy. Fight, win, lose, master new tricks, and come back stronger every new battle.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/4bb746e7cbd5aff1244605c44a1f2499.poster.avif?t=1788084979\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/4bb746e7cbd5aff1244605c44a1f2499.webm?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/4bb746e7cbd5aff1244605c44a1f2499.mp4?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Agent, each with unique abilities that define how you fight, hold ground, and time your strikes to maintain momentum. Every tank in HEAT is upgradable. Tune your tank and mix experimental modules to match your playstyle. Every combination feels different on the battlefield, so experiment until you find what clicks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/a53a10298013110d85ce72a28454f664.poster.avif?t=1788084979\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/a53a10298013110d85ce72a28454f664.webm?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/a53a10298013110d85ce72a28454f664.mp4?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEAT is powered by a completely new engine built from the ground up, with full support for the most advanced lighting systems, particle effects, and VFX available. This makes every explosion, impact, and ability feel like you’re witnessing it live. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/5415d332244fa1a896d5f01c982e634e.poster.avif?t=1788084979\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/5415d332244fa1a896d5f01c982e634e.webm?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/5415d332244fa1a896d5f01c982e634e.mp4?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEAT runs seamlessly on PC (Wargaming Game Center and Steam), Steam Deck, PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, and GeForce NOW. All your Agents and tanks are ready for action, no matter what gear you play on. Log in with a single Wargaming account to sync your progression instantly across all your devices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/fcc5fea6e2905d4934678470b22184f8.poster.avif?t=1788084979\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/fcc5fea6e2905d4934678470b22184f8.webm?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/fcc5fea6e2905d4934678470b22184f8.mp4?t=1788084979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HEAT is set in an alternate post-WWII timeline, where science has triumphed and the world blooms with technical marvels. But peace is fragile, and behind the facade of harmony lurks an intensifying arms race. Your arsenal will be packed with cutting-edge technologies, all based on real-life scientific and design concepts. This &quot;what if&quot; machinery is heavy, brutal, and built to shred armor. It is a world where engineering beauty is forged for the frontlines. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras/e18320287f0ea5061225efc433882fdb.avif?t=1788084979\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/extras_big/e18320287f0ea5061225efc433882fdb.webp?t=1788084979 width=1560 height=596 /></span></p>", "short_description": "World of Tanks: HEAT is the first ever hero-driven tank action game. Choose your Agent, personalize your tank, and combine skill and strategy to dominate the battlefield.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian, Traditional Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“World of Tanks: HEAT is a step forward for the franchise.”<br />\r\nIGN, Spain<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“When tank battles become a hero shooter.”<br />\r\nEurogamer, Germany<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“The combination of RC-style controls and the fun of a shooter feels fresh.”<br />\r\nFamitsu, Japan<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/997337e1ed5ece9c9aadea13cf6b0cd6fdd72465/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1788084979", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/e79ae09a7b7738cecd3d897550c1ec1f90982168/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1788084979", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100280/e79ae09a7b7738cecd3d897550c1ec1f90982168/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1788084979", "website": "https://wotheat.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>